            "review_title": "Review at Busshari - Modern Japanese Eatery",
            "review_text": "dean o\n1 contribution\n0\nWorld Class Food, Service, and Atmosphere\nJun 2026 • Solo\nAn absolutely incredible experience from start to finish. The food was exceptional, genuinely world class, and the service matched it perfectly.\n\nThe Wagyu hotpot was the standout for me. It was so good that I came back twice in three days just to have it again. Sitting at the chef’s table made the experience even more memorable. The chefs were friendly, happy to chat, and it was fascinating to watch them work their magic up close.\n\nA special mention to Ben, who leads the front of house team. His attentive and personalised service, along with some excellent recommendations, really brought everything together and made the whole experience feel effortless.\n\nI can’t wait to return and would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a truly outstanding dining experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 14, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
