            "review_text": "Food Lover\nKingscliff, Australia16 contributions\n0\nBest Japanese you will find anywhere!\nFeb 2025 • Family\nWe have visited many Michigan star ⭐️ restaurants around the world and this New 1 month old Japanese restaurant in HCMC Was up there with the best of them even though they are not Michigan ⭐️ \nWe ordered 4 different cocktails which were all very tasty and refreshing just like a good cocktail should be!! \nThe food is soo fresh and well presented and prepared… \nI ordered loads of different food dishes from all over the menu and the chefs sent it out all in the right order and at the right time!!! They were amazing. The staff are soo friendly and are always there when you need them, my family and I can’t wait to go back… \nWe are staying here for 6 nights and I am already dreaming about the next dishes I will order tomorrow…. \nSo do your self a favor and book a table tonight! You will not be disappointed!!…\nRead more\nWritten February 10, 2025",
